---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const meet = 'https://meet.google.com/mdn-uetc-bco';
---

<Base title="vir">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 class="heading">Able Bodied 2 Year Celebration / Trivia night<br />Join virtually at 5:30pm or 7:25pm on Monday June 22 2026</h1>
      <h2 class="sub">Join us to watch two award winning documentaries plus trivia night with prizes (<a href="/2026/06/04/watch-two-awesome-documentaries-plus-trivia-night-with-prizes/">details</a>)</h2>
      <div class="btn-wrap"><a class="btn" href={meet}>Click here to join virtually</a></div>
      <div class="text">
        <p><b>Schedule</b></p>
        <p>5:30pm – 6:10pm PST: Mingle online in <a href={meet}>Google meet</a></p>
        <p>6:25pm – 7:10pm PST: Watch <a href="https://watch.eventive.org/bestdayever/play/69727c118f16d4f35037d1d7">Best Day Ever</a> ($10)</p>
        <p>7:10pm – 7:25pm PST: Watch <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EE696qDOy-Y">QUINN BRETT AND THE TOUR DIVIDE</a> (FREE)</p>
        <p>It is OK to watch the movies above on your own time and join the <a href={meet}>Google Meet</a> at 7:25pm</p>
        <p>7:25pm – 7:35pm PST: Learn about Able Bodied and the BORP summer cycling program (<a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1G-N51yIjaYZeli1v7cW7nU8CebIY2ew36yehZ87I03w/edit?usp=sharing">slides</a>)</p>
        <p>7:35pm – 8:00pm PST: Adaptive sports trivia night (<a href="https://kahoot.it/?pin=132767&refer_method=link">click to join Kahoot</a>)</p>
        <p>Follow us on <a href="http://www.youtube.com/@AbleBodiedOrg">YouTube</a>, <a href="https://www.facebook.com/AbleBodiedOrg">Facebook</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ablebodiedorg/">Instagram</a>, and/or <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@ablebodiedorg">TikTok</a></p>
        <p><a href="/borp/">Sign up for a BORP ride</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .sub {
    font-size: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>
